//     (query, expected throw type name OR null, expected token stream OR null)
// Written with the same ExpectedToken matchers as the handwritten tokenizer tests, so renaming a
// token type, matcher or exception is a compile error here, never a silent pass.
// Edit entries as part of a deliberate tokenizer behavior change (review = diff of this file);
// add entries together with new syntax/features. Pure refactorings must keep every entry here
// passing untouched.

